 "title": "Mood in Spanish: The Subjunctive, the Conditional, the Imperative, and Conditions",
 "sub": "The indicative and the subjunctive, the conditional, the imperative, the sequence of tenses, and the clauses with si.",
 "sources": "Real Academia Española and Asociación de Academias de la Lengua Española, <i lang=\"es\">Nueva gramática de la lengua española: Manual</i> (2010), sections 23.8, 24.3, 25, 42.2, and 47.4; Allen and Greenough, <i lang=\"es\">New Latin Grammar</i>",
